        "c881bee1-4371-4f15-a92b-20258bde0555": "Private Land",
        "bb9e3dbb-0193-4f1a-bf6b-910efbf79f5d": "A land parcel owned outright by the company; may include surface ownership alone or both surface and mineral rights and can be used for mining operations, equipment storage, or other activities.",
